    "An account's organization has blocked Gmail.": {
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "An account you switch away from stays in memory for this long, then unloads to free around 450MB. Unread counts and notifications keep arriving either way, and returning to an unloaded account reopens it where you left off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual"
